sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: EFZ — staged mutation and discovery retention in the active corpus
    accDescr: A successful input with new probes is persisted before admission to the active corpus; the scheduler receives it in a future round.
    autonumber
    participant W as efz_worker
    participant C as efz_corpus
    participant P as efz_mutation_plan
    participant M as efz_mutation
    participant R as efz_recipe
    participant E as efz_executor
    participant F as efz_feedback
    participant S as efz_corpus_store
    Note over W,S: Initial and restored seeds passed executor and feedback calibration
    loop While the campaign budget and scheduler allow progress
        W->>C: mutation_entries()
        C-->>W: Entries: maps with id and input
        W->>P: next(PlanState, Entries)
        P->>P: Choose entry, stage lane and cursor
        P->>M: apply_operation(Primary, Op, Limits)
        M-->>P: {ok, Candidate} or skip/error
        alt Candidate found
            P-->>W: {candidate, Input, Provenance, NextPlan}
            W->>R: make(Provenance, Input, MutationConfig, Builds)
            R-->>W: Recipe: parent, primary, hashes, operations
            W->>W: efz_input:check(Input, Max, mutation)
            W->>E: run(Target, Input, Timeout, Options)
            Note over E: Guardian + coordinator + owned tree, cleanup before result
            E-->>W: Result: outcome, coverage, observation integrity, pinned identities
            W->>W: Record observed modules independently of successful global coverage
            W->>F: evaluate(FeedbackState, Result, mutation)
            alt Valid successful outcome and New != empty
                F-->>W: {ok, F1, Decision}, new_probes = New
                W->>C: add(Input, Metadata with parent ID and Recipe)
                alt New binary
                    opt corpus_dir enabled
                        C->>S: save(Store, Input, NextId, Metadata)
                        S-->>C: {ok, Record} after rename + fsync
                    end
                    C->>C: Append entry, increment next ID
                    C-->>W: {ok, Id}
                    W->>W: discoveries += 1, accept F1
                    Note over W,C: New Input is available to the scheduler as primary and donor in the next round
                else Binary already exists
                    C-->>W: {existing, Input}
                    W->>W: Accept F1, existing_input without a new entry
                end
            else Success without new coverage
                F-->>W: {ok, F1, equivalent_coverage decision}
                W->>W: Accept F1, rejections += 1
            else Target exception / exit / timeout
                F-->>W: {ok, previous F, target_failure decision}
                W->>W: efz_crash:identify/3 + save/4, persist selected raw representatives
                W->>W: durable summary count += 1, bounded disk/report representatives and decisions
            else Invalid coverage or infrastructure outcome
                F-->>W: {error, Reason}
                W->>W: infrastructure failure, end campaign
            end
        else Visit produced no candidate
            P-->>W: {skip, Reason, NextPlan}
            Note over W,E: Executor is not called; the progress model retains the cursor
        else Exhaustion / idle guard / error
            P-->>W: {done, Reason, NextPlan} or {error, Reason, NextPlan}
            W->>W: Final report with a separate stop reason
        end
    end
    W->>W: Report unused artifacts, strict policy fails if no probes ever observed
    Note over W,S: A corpus/crash storage error stops the campaign; input and reason remain in failure_context
